olio segment primarily earns revenue from the wholesale of our exclusive and licensed brands to retailers, our Retail segment, and international distributors and the sale of our Vince Camuto, Keds, and Topo brands through direct-to-consumer e-commerce sites.","filed":"2026-03-30","text_path":"text/DBI/0001319947-26-000022-business.txt","text_chars":25709}}